                                "sense_id": "40a87c5c-8c16-3c83-987c-ca878e487cb4",
                                "text": "March 25, 1894, Alexander Berkman, \"letter to Fedy\", republished in 1912 in Prison Memoirs of an Anarchist\nSleepless, I toss on the withered mattress. The ravages of time and the weight of many inmates have demoralized it out of all semblance of a bedtick. But the Block Captain persistently ignores my request for new straw, directing me to \"shake it up a bit.\""
                            }
                        ]
